# Live config for this shop's Supabase project.
#
# Tracked on purpose: this repo is PRIVATE, and both values below are
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ — Next.js inlines them into the browser bundle, so every phone
# that loads the app already has them. Row Level Security, not secrecy, is what
# protects the data.
#
# If this repo is ever made public: rotate the anon key in Supabase
# (Settings -> API), and drop the !.env.local line from duka-lite/.gitignore.
# The service_role key must never appear here — it bypasses RLS completely.
